    <h2>Five days is not very long. It is also plenty.</h2>
    <p class="muted">Get the dates, pricing and application before anyone else. No commitment, no sales pitch — just the information when it exists.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn" href="#join">Express interest <span class="arr">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

